4. Methodology

The assessment follows a structured process:

    Confirm the target and authorized scope.
    Access the application and identify relevant functionality.
    Execute controlled tests in the local lab.
    Record actual results and sanitized evidence.
    Verify whether the observed behaviour supports the suspected vulnerability.
    Assess impact and calculate CVSS 3.1.
    Map findings to applicable OWASP categories.
    Recommend fixes and define retesting criteria.

